    {
      "id": "P",
      "name": "GBM Rate",
      "type": "stochastic_process",
      "container": "path",
      "description": "Per-step risk-neutral GBM rate (drift r, vol sigma). Returns a per-step RATE so the S accumulator reproduces exact GBM: S *= exp((r-sigma^2/2)dt + sigma*sqrt(dt)Z). Drift and vol are EXPRESSION-VALUED \u2014 they reference the editable r and sigma constants directly (one source of truth), resolved against the run context before each draw.",
      "process": {
